<scroll-view class="feature-page" scroll-y>
  <view class="feature-hero"><text class="feature-kicker">DISTINCTION QUIZ</text><text class="feature-title">不是背答案，是练区别</text><text class="feature-copy">题目直接来自小程序现有疑难辨析分组。挑战不会改词卡 FSRS；整组答对后才标记为已掌握。</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{state === 'intro'}}" class="panel"><text class="panel-title">{{available}} 个真实辨析组</text><text class="feature-copy">每次抽 10 组，按释义选择正确词形。</text><button class="primary" bindtap="start">开始挑战</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{state === 'quiz'}}" class="panel"><text class="muted">{{index + 1}} / {{questions.length}} · {{question.typeName}}</text><view class="quiz-prompt"><text class="quiz-meaning">{{question.prompt}}</text><text class="quiz-hint">{{question.hint}}</text></view><view wx:for="{{question.options}}" wx:key="id" class="option {{revealed && item.id === question.answerId ? 'right' : ''}} {{revealed && selected === item.id && item.id !== question.answerId ? 'wrong' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="answer"><text class="list-title">{{item.form}}</text><text class="list-sub">{{item.kana}}</text></view><button wx:if="{{revealed}}" class="primary" bindtap="next">{{index + 1 === questions.length ? '查看结果' : '下一题'}}</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{state === 'result'}}" class="panel"><text class="feature-kicker">RESULT</text><text class="feature-title">{{correct}} / {{questions.length}}</text><text class="feature-copy">答对的辨析组已标记为掌握；答错的保留在列表里，之后还能继续练。</text><button class="secondary" bindtap="start">再来一组</button></view>
</scroll-view>
